---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../styles/excel-reporting.css";
---
<Layout title="Website privacy | Trellis Works" description="How the Trellis Works Excel reporting page handles booking, email enquiries and campaign information.">
  <main id="main" class="report-container report-section" style="max-width:760px;min-height:75vh">
    <p class="report-eyebrow">Website privacy · November 17, 2026</p><h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,4rem);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-bottom:32px">A simple way to start a conversation.</h1>
    <div style="display:grid;gap:26px">
      <section><h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:10px">Booking and enquiries</h2><p>The reporting page does not collect or upload spreadsheets. Booking links open Google Appointment Schedules, where you provide your details to arrange a call. Google’s privacy terms apply to that service. Email links open a draft in your email service; nothing is sent until you send it.</p></section>
      <section><h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:10px">Information you choose to share</h2><p>We use information you provide through booking or email to respond to your enquiry and discuss the proposed work. Start with a description of your workflow. We agree an appropriate sharing and handling process before receiving business files. Do not include passwords or sensitive client records in an initial enquiry.</p></section>
      <section><h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:10px">Website and campaign information</h2><p>Cloudflare hosts this website and processes standard connection information to serve and protect it. Campaign URLs may contain labels identifying an ad or campaign. The reporting page prepares limited page-view and click events inside your browser, using only approved campaign labels. No additional analytics service is connected to those events, and the page does not send them to a tracking endpoint or set analytics cookies. Booking clicks do not confirm that an appointment was booked.</p></section>
      <section><h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:10px">Questions</h2><p>For questions about information you have shared with Trellis Works, contact <a class="text-link" style="margin-top:0" href="mailto:info@trellisworks.ca">info@trellisworks.ca</a>.</p></section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <footer class="report-footer"><div class="report-container footer-row"><a href="/">Trellis Works</a><a href="/excel-reporting/">Excel reporting automation</a></div></footer>
</Layout>
